### Reservo API requests for IntelliJ's built-in HTTP Client (open this file, click the green arrow next to a request).
### Pick the "dev" environment in the top-right dropdown. The tokens are stored automatically by the login requests.

### 1. Log in as the seeded customer  (stores {{customerToken}})
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "customer@reservo.local", "password": "Customer@123" }

> {% client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Log in as staff  (stores {{staffToken}})
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff@reservo.local", "password": "Staff@123" }

> {% client.global.set("staffToken", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Log in as admin  (stores {{adminToken}})
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@reservo.local", "password": "Admin@123" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### 4. Register a new customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Test User", "email": "test.user@example.com", "phone": "+250788123456", "password": "Password123" }

### 5. Who am I?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 6. Browse restaurants (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants?q=&page=0&size=12

### 7. Restaurant menu (MongoDB document, public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/1/menu

### 8. Availability for a date (change the date to a future day)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/1/availability?date=2030-01-15&partySize=2

### 9. Book a table (customer) - change the date to a future day
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "restaurantId": 1, "date": "2030-01-15", "time": "19:00", "partySize": 2, "specialRequests": "Window seat" }

### 10. My reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 11. Staff: all reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 12. Staff: confirm reservation 1  (triggers RabbitMQ -> email + SMS)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### 13. Staff: today's stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 14. RBAC check - a customer must get 403 here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 15. Admin: list users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 16. Admin: RabbitMQ notification audit log (MongoDB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
